    "en": {
      "trackName": "Mini Chess - Watch Game",
      "description": "Enjoy the timeless strategy game of chess directly on your watch. Mini Chess delivers a clean, fast, and intuitive experience designed specifically for small screens.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Play Against AI – Challenge the built-in chess engine and improve your skills anytime.\n• Local Multiplayer – Pass and play with a friend on the same device.\n• Optimized for watchOS – Designed with large tap-friendly squares and smooth animations for comfortable gameplay.\n• Legal Move Highlights – Tap a piece to instantly see available moves.\n• Full Chess Rules – Includes castling, pawn promotion, check and checkmate detection.\n• Offline Play – No internet connection required.\n\nSharpen your mind and enjoy classic chess wherever you are.",
      "releaseNotes": "",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/mini-chess-watch-game/id6759561984?uo=4",
